	"notes": [
		{
			"id": "nsdMwBF0Eo60UHBay",
			"text": "Typical Stats from the package record: ST 22, DX 11, IQ 4, HT 12, HP 22, WILL 8, PER 9, FP 12, SPEED 5.75, MOVE 10, DODGE 8, DR 0. GCS derives its own values by applying the ancestry; where the two differ, the package's Typical Stats are what the Dungeons on Automatic encounter tables use."
		},
		{
			"id": "n9k8q4DymfQqGN8g1",
			"text": "Encounter rating: CER 34 (offense 22, protection 12), threat tier standard, appearing 5."
		},
		{
			"id": "nQRUxIKHgxbMCEY6g",
			"text": "GCS ancestry draft: gcs/elk.gct"
		},
		{
			"id": "n7Ij-IteONa6VCYXf",
			"text": "Independent build total: -11 points of racial traits plus 6 points of racial skills."
		},
		{
			"id": "nL6CO7VHqOVrJaTg1",
			"text": "Answers the SRD heading(s): Elk (SRD 5.1). Only the creature identity is taken from the SRD; the GURPS statistics, ratings and prose are this project's own work and reproduce no SRD text."
		},
		{
			"id": "nxK63nbVHYJ-zHCX3",
			"text": "Typical Stats, damage and ratings are derived from the racial template, not authored beside it, so the sheet and the stat block cannot disagree."
		},
		{
			"id": "nkCQPuhYxHsTbZoI7",
			"text": "Movement: ground Move 5, 10 at a sprint (primary). The published Move folds this creature's Enhanced Move into a single figure."
		},
		{
			"id": "nENj1NSCST04fVoCN",
			"text": "Treasure and grappling are not authored for this batch and ship as explicit nulls; `lair` carries a short habitat note, because where a wandering animal dens is an encounter fact rather than a loot one."
		},
		{
			"id": "n4pFY-xjBWZDFyDkp",
			"text": "Added after a post-hoc comparison against independent GURPS fan conversions of this creature: Peripheral Vision. The comparison surfaced the gap; the build is still ours."
